// Copy to Config/Local.xcconfig and uncomment + fill in your Team ID.
// Local.xcconfig is gitignored — each developer keeps their own copy.
//
// WHY: With a stable Apple Development certificate, macOS remembers
// Accessibility and Screen Recording across rebuilds. Without it, every
// rebuild uses ad-hoc signing and permissions reset.
//
// SETUP (one time):
//   1. Xcode → Settings → Accounts → add your Apple ID
//   2. Select your account → Manage Certificates → + → Apple Development
//   3. Find Team ID: Xcode → Settings → Accounts → (your team) → Team ID
//      Or run: security find-identity -v -p codesigning
//   4. Uncomment the two lines below and paste your Team ID
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
// CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development
